# Locked core packages - REQUIRED to boot and assemble the image.
# Managed by the SDK (REQUIRED set in scripts/package). Do NOT remove:
#   linux-image-amd64  the kernel (no kernel = no boot)
#   systemd-sysv       /sbin/init (PID 1)
#   syslinux-utils     provides isohybrid for the iso-hybrid assembly step
linux-image-amd64
systemd-sysv
syslinux-utils
